    "detailed_description": "Spaceship Ace Pilot is a physics driven space simulation game that will push your skills to the limit. Your goal is to collect all power cells in the level in order to execute a hyper jump to the next level. The task wont be easy, there are many obstacles in your way, like space mines, electric gates, flamers, black holes and many other. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to be the best spaceship pilot in the galaxy?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nSingle player<br />\r\nSimple arcade style gameplay<br />\r\nPhysics simulation",
